    en: 'Trelew, the heart of Welsh colonization in Patagonia, is an important industrial and commercial center of Chubut. With the most important regional airport in Atlantic Patagonia, it\'s the gateway to Valdés Peninsula. Its real estate market offers more affordable properties than premium coastal cities.',
    barrios: ['Centro', 'Ciudadela', 'Planta Industrial', 'Barrio San Pablo'],
