    en: 'Tandil, in Buenos Aires\' Tandilia Sierras, is the epicenter of gourmet and nature tourism in the Buenos Aires province. Famous for its artisan cheese, salami, and dulce de leche, Tandil attracts affluent Buenos Aires residents and tourists year-round. Its real estate market combines residential properties, country houses, and boutique accommodations in full growth.',
