    en: 'Pinamar is the premium seaside resort of the Buenos Aires Atlantic coast, known for its pine-framed beachfront homes. With Valeria del Mar and Ostende as exclusive neighbors, Pinamar concentrates demand for high-end summer vacations and the most expensive second-home properties on the Argentine coast. The USD market is very active in season.',
